This kid has actual anti-magic.

282
00:16:11,740 --> 00:16:13,180
Where am I?

283
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,140
What is this stuff?

284
00:16:15,900 --> 00:16:17,280
It feels sort of nice.

285
00:16:17,500 --> 00:16:21,140
Only those people who have been acknowledged by the Master may go where we are headed.

286
00:16:21,140 --> 00:16:23,640
We don't need more unnecessary trouble.

287
00:16:24,020 --> 00:16:26,000
Kill him before the Master comes for us.

288
00:16:28,180 --> 00:16:30,620
You know I'd be happy to kill him for you.

289
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:33,000
The brat would make a good addition to my playthings.

290
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:34,260
You stay out of it, Raiden.

291
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:34,880
Not good.

292
00:16:35,120 --> 00:16:35,660
No fair.

293
00:16:35,960 --> 00:16:37,680
