303
00:16:56,160 --> 00:16:57,600
Just think of how much we can learn.

304
00:16:57,840 --> 00:16:59,500
This girl is completely nuts.

305
00:16:59,500 --> 00:16:59,700
I'll be like to say.

306
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:02,340
