Because I will.

311
00:17:08,260 --> 00:17:09,620
Pretty, pretty, pretty, please.

312
00:17:11,700 --> 00:17:13,780
Whatever you do, just leave me out of it.

313
00:17:13,780 --> 00:17:14,580
