317
00:17:23,600 --> 00:17:24,160
What?

318
00:17:25,080 --> 00:17:25,540
Ooh!

319
00:17:25,900 --> 00:17:26,460
No!

320
00:17:26,800 --> 00:17:27,620
It can't be!

321
00:17:28,280 --> 00:17:31,320
The Wizard King, Julius Novokrono.

322
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,900
How did he find us?

323
00:17:33,100 --> 00:17:33,960
Why is he here?

324
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:35,940
Did you have a pleasant visit to the capital?

325
00:17:36,500 --> 00:17:37,520
Kill him now!

326
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:48,360
They're gone!

327
00:17:48,780 --> 00:17:49,320
How did you-

328
00:17:49,320 --> 00:17:50,620
Yeah, sorry about that.

329
00:17:51,280 --> 00:17:53,940
It would have been too difficult to restrain all of you.

330
00:17:54,900 --> 00:17:56,360
Much easier for me this way.

331
00:17:56,360 --> 00:18:07,600
You started this.

332
00:18:07,920 --> 00:18:09,740
It was your choice to attack the capital.

333
00:18:10,360 --> 00:18:11,320
And now you're nervous?

334
00:18:12,040 --> 00:18:15,200
Don't tell me you came to kill without being prepared to die yourselves.

335
00:18:16,040 --> 00:18:16,940
So strong.

336
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,660
But what did I expect?

337
00:18:19,220 --> 00:18:20,480
He is the Wizard King.

338
00:18:20,480 --> 00:18:23,280
And with my magic power drained.

339
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:24,700
Tell you what.

340
00:18:24,700 --> 00:18:27,460
You're skilled enough to make this a bit of a challenge.

341
00:18:27,620 --> 00:18:30,320
But I'd rather not go to the trouble.

342
00:18:31,140 --> 00:18:32,420
So let's make a deal.

343
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:35,040
I'll let the first person to surrender survive.

344
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:36,980
Well, do we have any takers?

345
00:18:37,460 --> 00:18:38,280
Don't be shy.

346
00:18:39,860 --> 00:18:40,920
Not happening!

347
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:53,560
How is he moving like that?

348
00:18:53,560 --> 00:18:55,600
He's so fast, I can't even see him!

349
00:18:56,980 --> 00:18:57,960
A test then.

350
00:18:58,720 --> 00:19:00,340
We'll see if it will work on this many.

351
