392
00:20:58,060 --> 00:20:59,560
Actually, hold that thought.

393
00:20:59,820 --> 00:21:02,880
You can't very well answer while caught up in my spell now, can you?

394
00:21:03,800 --> 00:21:06,720
We'll have a nice chat about it later back in the Clover Kingdom.

